data: {"id": "944800e5307c4f71-thinking-parallel_evidence-874", "run_id": "944800e5307c4f71", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已获取 baseline 结果：\n- **Metrics (prometheus)**: `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (Pending), `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (ImagePullBackOff), `restarts=0`。确认 Pod 当前处于 Pending + ImagePullBackOff 状态，未恢复。\n- **Logging (elasticsearch)**: empty (Pod 未启动，无业务日志)。\n- **Tracing (deepflow/tempo)**: empty (Pod 未启动，无业务流量/Trace)。\n\n下一步必须获取 **Kubernetes Events** 以确认 ImagePull 失败的具体原因（如认证失败、镜像不存在、网络超时等），并获取 **Pod YAML** 确认 Image 和 imagePullSecrets 配置。\n\n执行 plan 中的第 1、2 步。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789041719800, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

