data: {"id": "944800e5307c4f71-thinking-parallel_evidence-1314", "run_id": "944800e5307c4f71", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据采集结论\n\n#### 1. 已确认事实\n- **当前状态**：Pod `workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` 仍处于 **Pending** 阶段，未恢复。\n- **异常表现**：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 为 `ImagePullBackOff`，且 `containerStatuses.reason` 确认为 `ImagePullBackOff`。\n- **具体错误根因（Events）**：Events 显示 `dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`。\n- **镜像配置**：Pod YAML 确认其使用的镜像为 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`，且**没有配置** `imagePullSecrets`。\n- **DNS 解析失败**：容器运行时尝试解析 `registry.invalid` 域名时，返回 `no such host`，表明集群 DNS（127", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789041726476, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "944800e5307c4f71-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "944800e5307c4f71", "seq": 1315, "ts_ms": 1789041733379, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 30.292, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-02", "name": "workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/944800e5307c4f71-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "40018a519a2fce35a6b538ae72a4417052227f9af680e5aaa985b59af724fa89", "bytes": 2451}, "snapshot_sha256": "3696bc49fe353e3e50b5f2a02f9b488de8fb13a5bd617f341c80062aa4110cca"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "944800e5307c4f71-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "944800e5307c4f71", "seq": 1316, "ts_ms": 1789041733379, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "944800e5307c4f71-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "944800e5307c4f71", "seq": 1317, "ts_ms": 1789041741179, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.8, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1529, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 状态：Pending；`container.waiting_reason`=\"ImagePullBackOff\"，`waiting_message`=\"Back-off pulling image \\\"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\\\"\" | 确认异常现象及阻塞原因 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod Phase：Pending；Container `app` 未就绪 (`ContainersNotReady`) | 确认容器未进入运行态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Pod 配置：`resource_request` (8Mi/5m)，`resource_limit` (32Mi/50m) | 资源请求与限制配置合理，非资源瓶颈 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`=\"1\" (reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\", sample_count=1) | 确认容器持续处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n当前日志与追踪系统显示 `not_applicable`（限制：容器未启动，物理上不会产生应用日志或业务 Trace），且 Metric 仅存在单样本，无趋势可评估。现有证据一致指向镜像拉取失败，且 K8s 状态提供了确切的域名与状态码。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n镜像仓库域名无效 (registry.invalid) → 集群 DNS 解析失败 → Kubelet 拉取镜像请求网络不可达 → Pod 状态转为 ImagePullBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因：Pod 配置使用了无效的私有镜像仓库域名 `'registry.invalid'`。\n- **证据支撑**：K8s 状态显示 `waiting_message` 明确包含 `\"Back-off pulling image \\\"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\\\"\"`，且 `container.waiting_reason` 为 `ImagePullBackOff`；Metric 数据 `fact-b89551fdaa9f` 同样确认了 `reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"`。\n- **现象解释**：由于域名无效，集群 DNS (127.0.0.53) 无法解析该主机名，导致 `kubelet` 无法建立网络连接以拉取镜像，从而进入 Back-off 重试并最终表现为 Pod 处于 `Pending` 和 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 状态：Pending；`container.waiting_reason`=\"ImagePullBackOff\"，`waiting_message`=\"Back-off pulling image \\\"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\\\"\" | 确认异常现象及阻塞原因 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod Phase：Pending；Container `app` 未就绪 (`ContainersNotReady`) | 确认容器未进入运行态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Pod 配置：`resource_request` (8Mi/5m)，`resource_limit` (32Mi/50m) | 资源请求与限制配置合理，非资源瓶颈 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`=\"1\" (reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\", sample_count=1) | 确认容器持续处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n当前日志与追踪系统显示 `not_applicable`（限制：容器未启动，物理上不会产生应用日志或业务 Trace），且 Metric 仅存在单样本，无趋势可评估。现有证据一致指向镜像拉取失败，且 K8s 状态提供了确切的域名与状态码。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n镜像仓库域名无效 (registry.invalid) → 集群 DNS 解析失败 → Kubelet 拉取镜像请求网络不可达 → Pod 状态转为 ImagePullBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因：Pod 配置使用了无效的私有镜像仓库域名 `'registry.invalid'`。\n- **证据支撑**：K8s 状态显示 `waiting_message` 明确包含 `\"Back-off pulling image \\\"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\\\"\"`，且 `container.waiting_reason` 为 `ImagePullBackOff`；Metric 数据 `fact-b89551fdaa9f` 同样确认了 `reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"`。\n- **现象解释**：由于域名无效，集群 DNS (127.0.0.53) 无法解析该主机名，导致 `kubelet` 无法建立网络连接以拉取镜像，从而进入 Back-off 重试并最终表现为 Pod 处于 `Pending` 和 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

